#: crates/reprise-gnome/src/ui/strings.rs:131
msgid "Welcome to Reprise"
msgstr "Benvenuto in Reprise"

#: crates/reprise-gnome/src/ui/strings.rs:132
msgid ""
"Reprise keeps your library local. If you enable online sources and the "
"Artwork plugin in Preferences, Reprise can retrieve missing album covers "
"from MusicBrainz and Cover Art Archive. Music files are changed only when "
"you explicitly edit tags or move tracks to Trash."
msgstr ""
"Reprise mantiene la tua libreria in locale. Se abiliti le sorgenti online "
"e il plugin Artwork nelle Preferenze, Reprise può recuperare le copertine "
"mancanti da MusicBrainz e Cover Art Archive. I file musicali vengono "
"modificati solo quando modifichi esplicitamente i tag o sposti i brani nel "
"Cestino."

